cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "PYRIN-PLAQUE Digital Twin"
message: "If you use this workbench, please cite it."
type: software
abstract: >-
  An auditable, public-data-only Claude Science workflow mapping MEFV/pyrin
  inflammasome biology to human atherosclerotic plaque cell states, bulk plaque
  instability, and a dimensionless pyroptosis digital twin. Hypothesis-generating,
  not a validated-target or clinical claim.
